    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Shop Simulator is a chill first-person simulation where every detail of running a Game store comes alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the ultimate video game store! where you sell video games, Consoles, or Gaming Notebooks, this game lets you live out your dream of running a thriving gaming business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store Management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determine where products are displayed, manage your inventory, and keep track of popular trends and adjust to the ever-changing demand of the market. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Store</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and personalize your own store, organize shelves and optimize for efficiency and aesthetics. Every detail is yours to customize, making your store truly one of a kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expands your Store</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinvest your profits to take your shop to the next level! Expand your store, License new game systems and hire more staff to become the best game store in town.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Shop Simulator is a chill first-person simulation where every detail of running a Game store comes alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the ultimate video game store! where you sell video games, Consoles, or Gaming Notebooks, this game lets you live out your dream of running a thriving gaming business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store Management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determine where products are displayed, manage your inventory, and keep track of popular trends and adjust to the ever-changing demand of the market. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Store</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and personalize your own store, organize shelves and optimize for efficiency and aesthetics. Every detail is yours to customize, making your store truly one of a kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expands your Store</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinvest your profits to take your shop to the next level! Expand your store, License new game systems and hire more staff to become the best game store in town.</p>",
